---
const logos = ["Astro", "Markdown", "GitHub", "Claude", "Cursor", "Codex"];
---

<section class="page py-section" id="logos" aria-label="Works with your stack">
  <p class="mb-6 text-sm text-muted">Works with the stack and agents you already have</p>
  <ul class="grid grid-cols-2 border border-line sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-6">
    {logos.map((name) => (
      <li class="flex min-h-20 items-center justify-center border-line border-r border-b px-4 text-center text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-ink last:border-r-0 odd:border-r sm:[&:nth-child(3n)]:border-r-0 md:border-b-0 md:[&:nth-child(3n)]:border-r md:[&:nth-child(6n)]:border-r-0">
        {name}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-muted">
    Same files. Same history. Same deploy — a draft is a branch, Publish is merge to main, and a checkpoint is a commit
    you can undo.
  </p>
</section>
